    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the developers of <i>Cris Tales</i> comes <i><strong>Prisma</strong></i>, a single-player, turn-based JRPG that blends vibrant visuals with innovative gameplay mechanics built around Alma's camera, a device that can reshape the very fabric of her world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Alma, a <strong>young photojournalist</strong> whose life takes an extraordinary twist when her camera is replaced by a mysterious device infused with prism shards. This enigmatic tool plunges her into an alternate dimension brimming with danger, thrilling adventures, and countless versions of herself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/cbc2d663de9c7bf445ccc23d17b641be.avif?t=1733930516\" width=800 height=143 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/21bed9d64b59d03d611fd5a5e93ea26f.poster.avif?t=1733930516\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/21bed9d64b59d03d611fd5a5e93ea26f.webm?t=1733930516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/21bed9d64b59d03d611fd5a5e93ea26f.mp4?t=1733930516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the innovative mechanics of <i>Persona 5</i> and <i>The World Ends With You</i>, <strong><i>Prisma</i> blends strategy and dynamism in unique battles that harness the power of the camera's lenses.</strong> Alma\u2019s prism-enhanced camera lets you <strong>shift perspectives, curve attack trajectories, and uncover new strategies on the battlefield.</strong> Experience a one of a kind <strong>JRPG</strong> where <strong>every lens unlocks unexpected possibilities!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <strong>Fish-Eye Lens</strong> to curve attacks, striking enemies hidden behind front lines.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/efe20a3ac0153533ce07f29a0eadaa72.poster.avif?t=1733930516\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/efe20a3ac0153533ce07f29a0eadaa72.webm?t=1733930516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/efe20a3ac0153533ce07f29a0eadaa72.mp4?t=1733930516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or use the <strong>Shattered Lens</strong> to divide your strikes and hit multiple enemies at once.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/d525c24882518a6ef5ff88693d39aa01.poster.avif?t=1733930516\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/d525c24882518a6ef5ff88693d39aa01.webm?t=1733930516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/d525c24882518a6ef5ff88693d39aa01.mp4?t=1733930516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/58ff4a29c10fbf16b0e50d4e5ba365f5.avif?t=1733930516\" width=800 height=169 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/9eb95508433dbb9c0c2a14e63da10e62.poster.avif?t=1733930516\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/9eb95508433dbb9c0c2a14e63da10e62.webm?t=1733930516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/9eb95508433dbb9c0c2a14e63da10e62.mp4?t=1733930516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a <strong>modern world where the unexpected is woven into daily life.</strong> As you journey through Domacon, you'll face enemies corrupted by the prism, some of which open portals that twist the world's appearance and functions.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/f2d1cfd3cc4d0d8c98ad2d341ef2457c.poster.avif?t=1733930516\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/f2d1cfd3cc4d0d8c98ad2d341ef2457c.webm?t=1733930516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with colorful characters and vibrant environments, forging alliances, encountering enemies, and unlocking quests as you go deeper into this ever-changing world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/3098cc056213d54a16359a35a9bf89b0.avif?t=1733930516\" width=800 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main rivals are <strong>other Almas</strong>, each shaped by their unique choices and perspectives, all trying to steal your Prism Shards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/261960b10057f65fc3551331dccf761f.poster.avif?t=1733930516\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/261960b10057f65fc3551331dccf761f.webm?t=1733930516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/261960b10057f65fc3551331dccf761f.mp4?t=1733930516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/e7d16dc40b99b0a2749199ea1c2e4138.poster.avif?t=1733930516\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/e7d16dc40b99b0a2749199ea1c2e4138.webm?t=1733930516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/e7d16dc40b99b0a2749199ea1c2e4138.mp4?t=1733930516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But not all are enemies, some will be <strong>friendly NPCs</strong>, offering quests, valuable items, and insight into the world through their own eyes. Others, however, will become <strong>your allies, joining your party</strong> to fight and aid you on your journey.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/c80836f924c3b6dbf7c7f07988ecd542.poster.avif?t=1733930516\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/c80836f924c3b6dbf7c7f07988ecd542.webm?t=1733930516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/1db8c5f06b557f9e92edf70f779fddbb.poster.avif?t=1733930516\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/1db8c5f06b557f9e92edf70f779fddbb.webm?t=1733930516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/1db8c5f06b557f9e92edf70f779fddbb.mp4?t=1733930516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/853c054fce6c41d3a061285e1a5d5ed3.avif?t=1733930516\" width=800 height=199 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the developers of <i>Cris Tales</i> comes <i><strong>Prisma</strong></i>, a single-player, turn-based JRPG that blends vibrant visuals with innovative gameplay mechanics built around Alma's camera, a device that can reshape the very fabric of her world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Alma, a <strong>young photojournalist</strong> whose life takes an extraordinary twist when her camera is replaced by a mysterious device infused with prism shards. This enigmatic tool plunges her into an alternate dimension brimming with danger, thrilling adventures, and countless versions of herself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/cbc2d663de9c7bf445ccc23d17b641be.avif?t=1733930516\" width=800 height=143 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/21bed9d64b59d03d611fd5a5e93ea26f.poster.avif?t=1733930516\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/21bed9d64b59d03d611fd5a5e93ea26f.webm?t=1733930516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/21bed9d64b59d03d611fd5a5e93ea26f.mp4?t=1733930516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the innovative mechanics of <i>Persona 5</i> and <i>The World Ends With You</i>, <strong><i>Prisma</i> blends strategy and dynamism in unique battles that harness the power of the camera's lenses.</strong> Alma\u2019s prism-enhanced camera lets you <strong>shift perspectives, curve attack trajectories, and uncover new strategies on the battlefield.</strong> Experience a one of a kind <strong>JRPG</strong> where <strong>every lens unlocks unexpected possibilities!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <strong>Fish-Eye Lens</strong> to curve attacks, striking enemies hidden behind front lines.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/efe20a3ac0153533ce07f29a0eadaa72.poster.avif?t=1733930516\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/efe20a3ac0153533ce07f29a0eadaa72.webm?t=1733930516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/efe20a3ac0153533ce07f29a0eadaa72.mp4?t=1733930516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or use the <strong>Shattered Lens</strong> to divide your strikes and hit multiple enemies at once.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/d525c24882518a6ef5ff88693d39aa01.poster.avif?t=1733930516\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/d525c24882518a6ef5ff88693d39aa01.webm?t=1733930516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/d525c24882518a6ef5ff88693d39aa01.mp4?t=1733930516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/58ff4a29c10fbf16b0e50d4e5ba365f5.avif?t=1733930516\" width=800 height=169 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/9eb95508433dbb9c0c2a14e63da10e62.poster.avif?t=1733930516\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/9eb95508433dbb9c0c2a14e63da10e62.webm?t=1733930516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/9eb95508433dbb9c0c2a14e63da10e62.mp4?t=1733930516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a <strong>modern world where the unexpected is woven into daily life.</strong> As you journey through Domacon, you'll face enemies corrupted by the prism, some of which open portals that twist the world's appearance and functions.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/f2d1cfd3cc4d0d8c98ad2d341ef2457c.poster.avif?t=1733930516\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/f2d1cfd3cc4d0d8c98ad2d341ef2457c.webm?t=1733930516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with colorful characters and vibrant environments, forging alliances, encountering enemies, and unlocking quests as you go deeper into this ever-changing world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/3098cc056213d54a16359a35a9bf89b0.avif?t=1733930516\" width=800 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main rivals are <strong>other Almas</strong>, each shaped by their unique choices and perspectives, all trying to steal your Prism Shards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/261960b10057f65fc3551331dccf761f.poster.avif?t=1733930516\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/261960b10057f65fc3551331dccf761f.webm?t=1733930516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/261960b10057f65fc3551331dccf761f.mp4?t=1733930516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/e7d16dc40b99b0a2749199ea1c2e4138.poster.avif?t=1733930516\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/e7d16dc40b99b0a2749199ea1c2e4138.webm?t=1733930516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/e7d16dc40b99b0a2749199ea1c2e4138.mp4?t=1733930516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But not all are enemies, some will be <strong>friendly NPCs</strong>, offering quests, valuable items, and insight into the world through their own eyes. Others, however, will become <strong>your allies, joining your party</strong> to fight and aid you on your journey.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/c80836f924c3b6dbf7c7f07988ecd542.poster.avif?t=1733930516\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/c80836f924c3b6dbf7c7f07988ecd542.webm?t=1733930516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/1db8c5f06b557f9e92edf70f779fddbb.poster.avif?t=1733930516\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/1db8c5f06b557f9e92edf70f779fddbb.webm?t=1733930516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/1db8c5f06b557f9e92edf70f779fddbb.mp4?t=1733930516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850910/extras/853c054fce6c41d3a061285e1a5d5ed3.avif?t=1733930516\" width=800 height=199 /></span></p>",
